	(text "dV/dt pin and C_{out}:\n\nLet:\nI_{inrush} = 60 mA\nC_{out} = 470 uF\n\nSlew Rate (V/ms) = I_{inrush} (mA) / C_{out} (uF) = 0.11 V/ms\n\nC_{32} (pF) = 2000 / Slew Rate (V/ms) = 18.8 nF\n\nt_{Rise} (ms) = V_{in} (V) / Slew Rate (V/ms) = 141 ms\n(This is worst case, usually t_{Rise} is higher)\n\nPD_{inrush} (W) = I_{inrush} (A) * V_{in} (V) / 2 = 0.38 W"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.874 126.238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9ed2a2e6-8622-4aa8-bc4b-cffd6d768ec2")
	)
